WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.262
Here is a question almost every family member asks quietly:

2
00:00:00.262 --> 00:00:00.457
if a cousin or sibling takes a losing trade,

3
00:00:00.457 --> 00:00:00.563
can it drain my account?

4
00:00:00.563 --> 00:00:00.692
The answer is an absolute no.

5
00:00:00.692 --> 00:00:01.016
Every family member has their own completely walled-off personal account.
